rem Dissonant Numbers
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=515

use numbers
use sequences
use io
use cli

arg A integer = 1000000000
arg B integer = 100000
arg K integer = 100000

rem For a prime p, d(p, p - 1, k) is
rem the inverse of k - 1 mod p, so sum
rem (k - 1)^(p - 2) mod p over the
rem primes a <= p < a + b.
P = primes from A till A + B array
Answer = ((K - 1) (P - 2) P powmod) sum
Answer print
